    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forklift Certified and a Manager?! Create product from next door via Minigames! These Turn into product which you distribute through the Tri-State area! Manage your Warehouse, upgrade and sort the products. Go through tons of different upgrades, factory sizes and earn Reputation with different Resellers!\u00a0<br>\u00a0<br>Don't forget to Ship your pants.\u00a0<br><br>Reputation:\u00a0<br>Earn Reputation with different resellers to earn more favor and money!\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>Leveling System:\u00a0<br>Level up to 20+, earning different rewards along the way to help increate productivity! <br><br>Expanding:\u00a0<br>Three different types of warehouses for you to expand!<br><br>Minigames:\u00a0<br>Several different Minigames that allow you to make product to move through your warehouse!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forklift Certified and a Manager?! Create product from next door via Minigames! These Turn into product which you distribute through the Tri-State area! Manage your Warehouse, upgrade and sort the products. Go through tons of different upgrades, factory sizes and earn Reputation with different Resellers!\u00a0<br>\u00a0<br>Don't forget to Ship your pants.\u00a0<br><br>Reputation:\u00a0<br>Earn Reputation with different resellers to earn more favor and money!\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>Leveling System:\u00a0<br>Level up to 20+, earning different rewards along the way to help increate productivity! <br><br>Expanding:\u00a0<br>Three different types of warehouses for you to expand!<br><br>Minigames:\u00a0<br>Several different Minigames that allow you to make product to move through your warehouse!</p>",
    "short_description": "Become Forklift Certified and manage your factory in this simple Top-Down Management game. Ship It! Ship yourself to the world where you control the flow of product to the companies you can earn reputation with!",
